[86.610052,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[86.610069,"o","\n"]
[86.610086,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[86.610103,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[86.61012,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[86.610137,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
